      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc setBatchSize(_ batchSize: Int, forFunction function: String? = nil) async\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc setBatchSize(_ batchSize: Int, forFunction function: String? = nil) async\n```",
