    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This is a special case of `setDynamicShapes(_:forFunction:)` where the only dynamic sizes that occur are the first index of their tensor (that is, the batch dimension) and are all equal.",
      "ko": "이는 `setDynamicShapes(_:forFunction:)`의 특수한 경우로, 동적 크기가 텐서의 첫 번째 인덱스(즉 배치 차원)에서만 발생하고 모두 동일합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fe25c372ad376c15d01a566c83d07683de199370eea58915703728495f937615",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "This allows just passing a single `batchSize` constant.",
      "ko": "단일 `batchSize` 상수만 전달하면 됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5bb7f868bc53fb7541eac8c0150712d8d07c7b30aed897adabf600fc60058510",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "This function has no effect if you pass a `batchSize` value that’s less than zero.",
      "ko": "`batchSize` 값이 0보다 작으면 이 함수는 영향을 주지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fe6ae8ee87a08a17488177d9dead2166f103f40c981bb24fbdf9c89f99b283ec",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: `BNNSGraphContextSetBatchSize`",
      "ko": "**참고**: `BNNSGraphContextSetBatchSize`",
      "sourceHash": "1c66a018bff30471250bc8c1de9c5d90f7b2da3257f63baace721f360d57d9e2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
